<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25792" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lănĭo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a.
		etym. dub.; cf. lacer, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκνω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to tear</i> or <i>rend in pieces, to
				mangle, lacerate</i> (class.; cf.: lacero, discerpo, dilanio).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hominem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 7, 1, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpora a feris laniata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tusc. 1, 45, 108</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lanianda viscera praebere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					9, 1, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laniando dentibus hostem exspirare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					22, 51, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foede crura brachiaque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					1, 41</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					5, 398</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 11, 3, 174</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Priamiden laniatum corpore toto vidit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 6, 494</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">digitis ora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 3, 678</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					33, 7, 18 <i>init.</i></span></i>
			—With <i>Gr. acc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flavos Lavinia crinīs, Et roseas
					laniata genas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 12, 606</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">comas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					4, 139</span></i>
			.—<b>Transf.</b>, <b>poet.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venti mundum laniant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 60</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laniata classis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. H.
					7, 175</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">et tua sacrilegae laniarunt carmina linguae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. R. Am. 367</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitia cor laniant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 51, 13</span></i>
			.</div>
